abstract: A fixed transcription of 設醫原由, Bodleian Sinica6530, limited to its single
  available recto, including the original heading, ward-illustration labels, main
  columns and small source notes. Catalogue date [1880s?] and place [Hankou?] remain
  uncertain; historical author and exact publication year are unknown. For histories
  of hospitals, medical charity and missionary printing, without modern medical interpretation
  or biological research. Initial AI transcription; independent reading is not applied.
  No human double collation, expert review, peer review or measured accuracy is claimed.
